# web/ — Serializers (Blueprinter)

Full guide: `docs/guidelines/web/serializers.md`. API: `docs/api/README.md`. Rule: `controllers`.

## Role

- Blueprints in `app/blueprints/` — field selection and nesting only, no business logic.
- Controllers render via `ModelBlueprint.render(...)` — never inline JSON hashes.

## Conventions

- `snake_case` keys; `amount_cents` as integer; ISO 8601 timestamps.
- Views: `:summary` for lists, `:detail` for show — `include_view` for DRY.
- Eager-load associations before render — blueprints must not cause N+1.
- Errors use standard `{ error: { code, message, details } }` envelope — not blueprints.

## Testing

- rswag request specs are the contract; run `rake rswag:specs:swaggerize` when shape changes.
